@*
    Migrated from ASP.NET Web Forms Master Page to ASP.NET Core Razor Pages Layout.
    Rule cr-dotnet-0026: Web Forms Usage – replaced <%@ Master %> directive (line 1)
    and all <asp:ContentPlaceHolder> / <form runat="server"> constructs with a
    standard Razor Layout (_DoctorLayout.cshtml) for cloud-native deployment on AWS.

    This file is retained as a reference / redirect shim.
    The active layout is now: Pages/Doctor/_DoctorLayout.cshtml
*@
@*
    NOTE: ASP.NET Core Razor Pages does not use .Master files.
    The master-page functionality has been moved to the shared Razor layout:
        ~/Pages/Doctor/_DoctorLayout.cshtml
    This file is kept for traceability only and is not compiled.
*@
